webrtc-audio-processing (standalone WebRTC Audio Processing Module, AEC3)

Source:   https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pulseaudio/webrtc-audio-processing.git
Tag:      v2.1
Commit:   846fe90a289f58b7c9303a635142aa2c7caa93e5
Subproject: abseil-cpp 20240722.0 (meson wrap, statically bundled into the archive)

Build (macOS arm64, static, release):
  export MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=15.6
  meson setup build -Ddefault_library=static --buildtype=release
  ninja -C build
  meson install -C build --destdir=<staging>

Wrapped for SwiftPM, which cannot link a loose .a without unsafe flags:
  xcodebuild -create-xcframework -library <staging>/lib/libwebrtc-audio-processing-2.a \
    -output Packages/EchoEngine/Vendor/WebRTCAPM.xcframework

Vendored artifacts (paths from the repository root):
  Packages/EchoEngine/Vendor/WebRTCAPM.xcframework/     — one macos-arm64 slice, consumed as a .binaryTarget
  Packages/EchoEngine/Vendor/licenses/                  — upstream BSD-3 (WebRTC) and Apache-2.0 (abseil)
  Packages/EchoEngine/Sources/CWebRTCAPM/vendor/include/webrtc-audio-processing-2/  — public headers (installed set)
  Packages/EchoEngine/Sources/CWebRTCAPM/vendor/include/absl/                       — abseil headers the public headers reference

The headers live inside the CWebRTCAPM target because SwiftPM cannot put a
header search path outside the target that uses it.

Consumer cflags (per upstream pkg-config): -DWEBRTC_POSIX
Both include roots are needed on the header search path:
  Packages/EchoEngine/Sources/CWebRTCAPM/vendor/include
  Packages/EchoEngine/Sources/CWebRTCAPM/vendor/include/webrtc-audio-processing-2
